{
  "actionName": "scheduling.find_bookings",
  "agentDescription": "Find the caller's upcoming appointments before any reschedule or cancel. Send the phone the caller gives (or their caller ID number) and the name on the booking. Caller ID is checked on the server, and a phone match alone lists nothing: the first name on the booking must match too. Until it does, verified is false: ask the one question in callerSafeMessage (askId), then call again. If needs is "name_date_time", also ask the date (send it as YYYY-MM-DD, the date in the tenant's timezone; get_current_tenant_time gives today's date) and time (HH:MM) of the appointment and never suggest a date or time yourself. If exit is set, do not ask again: offer to take a message. Only a verified result lists bookings: read their spoken text, and if there is more than one, ask which. Never say whether an unverified number has appointments, and never read a booking id aloud.",
  "description": "Find the caller's upcoming appointments before any reschedule or cancel. Send the phone the caller gives (or their caller ID number) and the name on the booking. Caller ID is checked on the server, and a phone match alone lists nothing: the first name on the booking must match too. Until it does, verified is false: ask the one question in callerSafeMessage (askId), then call again. If needs is "name_date_time", also ask the date (send it as YYYY-MM-DD, the date in the tenant's timezone; get_current_tenant_time gives today's date) and time (HH:MM) of the appointment and never suggest a date or time yourself. If exit is set, do not ask again: offer to take a message. Only a verified result lists bookings: read their spoken text, and if there is more than one, ask which. Never say whether an unverified number has appointments, and never read a booking id aloud.",
